{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/39823","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:51.196253+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"# Bug Report: \n\nThis bug is triggered by the HLO-to-StableHLO conversion: the HLO module runs successfully via `run_hlo_module --input_format=hlo`, and the conversion via `hlo-translate --hlo-to-mlir` also succeeds, but running the translated StableHLO via `run_hlo_module --input_format=stablehlo` fails with:\n\n> `RET_CHECK failure (xla/hlo/ir/hlo_input_output_alias_config.cc:218) ShapeUtil::IndexIsValid(param_shape, alias.parameter_index)`\n\n## Environment\n\n- **XLA commit**: `5ce7908a2d32a9f91fd99380435cda1b645c8cc7`\n- **CPU**: `Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900HX`\n- **GPU**: `NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU`\n- **CUDA Driver**: `580.126.09`\n\n## run_hlo_module (HLO) — Success\n\n**HLO:**\n\n```\nHloModule CrossingParameters, input_output_alias={ {0}: (0, {0}, may-alias), {1}: (0, {1}, may-alias) }, entry_computation_layout={((f32[], f32[]))->(f32[], f32[])}\n\nENTRY CrossingParameters {\n  _ = (f32[], f32[]) parameter(0)\n  get-tuple-element.1 = f32[] get-tuple-element(_), index=1\n  get-tuple-element = f32[] get-tuple-element(_), index=0\n  ROOT tuple = (f32[], f32[]) tuple(get-tuple-element.1, get-tuple-element)\n}\n```\n\n**Execution Command:**\n\n```bash\nrun_hlo_module \\\n  --platform=CPU \\\n  --reference_platform= \\\n  --input_format=hlo \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.hlo\n```\n\n**Output:**\n\n```\n\n ** Running CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.hlo** \nRunning HLO module with runner Host...\n... compiled and ran in 0.00761393s.\nSkipping reference runner\n\n```\n\n## run_hlo_module (StableHLO) — FAIL\n\n**Translation Command:**\n\n```bash\nhlo-translate \\\n  --hlo-to-mlir \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.hlo \\\n  -o \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.mlir\n```\n\n**IR After Translation:**\n\n```mlir\nmodule @CrossingParameters attributes {mhlo.cross_program_prefetches = [], mhlo.input_output_alias = [{alias = {kind = \"may_alias\", parameter_index = array<i64: 0>, parameter_number = 0 : i64}, output_index = array<i64: 0>}, {alias = {kind = \"may_alias\", parameter_index = array<i64: 1>, parameter_number = 0 : i64}, output_index = array<i64: 1>}], mhlo.is_dynamic = false, mhlo.use_auto_spmd_partitioning = false} {\n  func.func @main(%arg0: tensor<f32>, %arg1: tensor<f32>) -> (tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>) {\n    return %arg1, %arg0 : tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Execution Command:**\n\n```bash\nrun_hlo_module \\\n  --platform=CPU \\\n  --reference_platform= \\\n  --input_format=stablehlo \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.mlir\n```\n\n**Output:**\n\n```\nWARNING: All log messages before absl::InitializeLog() is called are written to STDERR\nE0000 00:00:1774416776.501961 2088137 status_macros.cc:58] INTERNAL: RET_CHECK failure (xla/hlo/ir/hlo_input_output_alias_config.cc:218) ShapeUtil::IndexIsValid(param_shape, alias.parameter_index) \n*** Begin stack trace ***\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t__libc_start_main\n\t\n*** End stack trace ***\n\n\n ** Running CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.mlir** \nINTERNAL: during context [Unknown]: RET_CHECK failure (xla/hlo/ir/hlo_input_output_alias_config.cc:218) ShapeUtil::IndexIsValid(param_shape, alias.parameter_index) \n\n```\n\n## Contact\n\n- **Email**: `ch395@njit.edu, zhihao.yao@njit.edu, benquike@gmail.com`\n","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/39823/comments","created_at":"2026-03-25T05:44:14Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/39823/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/39823","id":4132728219,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color